  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are able to use your arcane powers to force spirits into good pacts with you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ability to cast bind spirit†, ability to cast 4th level arcane spells.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When casting a bind spirit† spell, you do not gain the personality influence of the chosen spirit and you can show or suppress the spirit’s physical sign at will, as if you had made a good pact with the spirit. Additionally, when you cast a bind spirit† spell, you may attempt a concentration check with a DC equal to the chosen spirit’s binder level. If you succeed, you gain the chosen spirit’s capstone empowerment for the spell’s duration in addition to its other granted abilities.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc41\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
